"description":"Cram AI: Study Notes, Quiz, Flashcards & AI Study Reels\nCram AI turns videos, PDFs, images and text into AI study notes, \nflashcards, quizzes, mind maps and now short AI Study Reels with \nanimated subtitles. Ace exams with study tools built for college, \nschool, and SAT/ACT prep.\n\nNEW: AI Study Reels\nTurn any topic into a short Minecraft-style video explained by one \nof unique AI teacher characters with synced animated subtitles.\n\nCreate Smart Notes from Any Source\n* YouTube videos (no downloading needed)\n* PDFs and documents\n* Images and screenshots\n* Typed or pasted text\n* Live class and voice recordings\n\nTurn Notes into Study Tools\n* AI Study Reels with animated subtitles and character voiceover\n* Mind maps for visual learning and big-picture understanding\n* Flashcards for spaced repetition and quick revision\n* Quizzes to test yourself before exams\n* AI chat for every note to explain, simplify, and answer questions\n\nFeynman Technique Mode\nExplain a topic as if teaching an 8, 15, or 22-year-old and get \ninstant AI feedback on what you remembered, what you missed, and \nwhere to improve.\n\nWhy Students Use Cram AI\n* AI Study Reels that make studying actually entertaining\n* AI note maker from any source\n* Study helper for last-minute revision\n* All-in-one: notes, flashcards, quizzes, mind maps, and AI tutor\n* Useful for school, college, competitive exams, and self-learning\n\nCram AI helps you study smarter, save hours of manual note-taking, \nand feel confident before every test.\n\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/cram-ai-terms-of-use/\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/cramlockai-privacy-policy/", "bundleId":"com.cramlock.ai", "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "averageUserRating":5, "trackCensoredName":"Cram AI - Study Notes, Quiz", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"265255936", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "userRatingCountFo