"description":"Stay Fit is a powerful workout tracker designed to help you build strength, stay consistent, and reach your fitness goals whether you train at home or in the gym.\nNo accounts. No ads. No distractions.\u2028Just a smarter way to train.\nStay Fit combines intelligent workout planning with advanced fitness tracking so you always know what to train, when to recover, and how to progress.\n\nTrain Smarter, Not Harder\nGet a personalized workout plan generated from your body metrics and goals. Stay Fit adapts to you helping beginners start strong and experienced users push further.\nTrack every workout and understand exactly how your body is improving over time.\n\nKey Features\nPersonalized Workout Plans\nCreate training plans tailored to your height, weight, age, fitness level, and goals. Your plan evolves as you progress so you never feel stuck.\n\nComplete Workout Tracking\nLog exercises, monitor performance, and build better habits with a structured workout tracker built for real results.\n\nStrength Insights\nSee which muscle groups you train the most and identify imbalances before they slow your progress.\n\nRecovery Tracking\nUnderstand how long each muscle group needs to recover so you can avoid overtraining and reduce injury risk.\n\nTrain Anywhere\nPerfect for both home workouts and gym training flexible enough to match your lifestyle.\n\nPrivacy First\nYour data stays on your device.\n* No login required\n* No cloud storage\n* No third-party tracking\n* No ads\nYou stay in full control of your fitness data.\n\nDesigned for Real Progress\nFitness is not about motivation it's about consistency.\u2028Stay Fit gives you the clarity and structure needed to keep showing up and improving.\nWhether your goal is building muscle, increasing strength, losing fat, or staying active, Stay Fit helps turn effort into measurable results.\nDownload Stay Fit today and take control of your training.\n\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/stay-fit-terms-of-use/\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/stay-fit-privacy-policy/", "bundleId":"com.fitness.stayfit", "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"Stay Fit: Workout Tracker", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"77323264", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stay-fit-workout-tracker/id6758268967?uo=4", "releaseDate":"2026-02-16T08:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":0}, 
