"description":"FitChase Gym & Home Workouts app is an expertly crafted fitness app that offers a variety of workouts and workout plans suitable for everyone, from fitness beginners to experts.\n\nWith no equipment required, you can start workouts anytime, anywhere whether you're at home, in the gym, or outdoors.\n\nAnd that's not all! FitChase Gym & Home Workouts also provides personalized workout plans tailored to your individual needs, whether your aim is to build muscle, lose weight, or simply stay fit.\n\nPlus, with a real-time workout tracker, your training data will be automatically recorded and you'll never miss a single workout progress. So why wait? Time to get ready to transform your body today with FitChase Gym & Home Workouts!\n\nFitChase puts your fitness journey first helping you achieve real, lasting results.\n1. Train Anytime & Anywhere\u2028Easy to start, easy to follow. Whether you’re at home or in the gym, FitChase brings your customized workouts to your fingertips no barriers, no excuses.\n\n2. Expert Tailored Workout Plans\u2028Want to gain muscle, lose weight, or simply get healthier? FitChase generates a personal workout plan designed just for you, based on your height, weight, age, body shape, and unique goals. Fast results, long-term progress.\n\n3. Massive Variety: 1300+ Workouts\u2028From fat loss to muscle building, from flexibility to mood boosting everyone finds what they need here. Choose from 1300+ home and gym workouts, targeting every fitness level and goal.\n\nWhy choose FitChase?\n• Both home & gym routines: get fitter anywhere, anytime\n• Tailored workout plans: customized for your height, weight, age, body shape, and goals\n• Custom reminders: never skip a workout\n• Affordable plans: enjoy unlimited access with a 7-day free trial Key Features\n• Personal Workout Plans: Personalize your routine based on your fitness level and goals\n• Smart Reminders: Stay consistent with workout notifications\n• Progress Tracking: Record your workouts, visualize your health trends\n• Apple Health Integration: Seamlessly sync step counts, calories, and more\n• Secure & Transparent Subscriptions: No hidden fees enjoy a smooth free trial and low yearly subscription\nReady to transform your body and mind at your pace? Tap to start FitChase and enjoy fitness that's truly personal.\n\nSubscription Details\n• Unlimited access to all features for a low annual fee\n• 7-day free trial cancel anytime during the trial for no charge\n• Payment charged to your iTunes account after purchase confirmation\n• Subscription auto-renews unless turned off at least 24 hours before period end\n• Manage renewals in Account Settings\nWith FitChase, your fitness journey fits your life at home, in the gym, or on the go.", "bundleId":"com.gymhomeworkouts.fitchase", "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"FitChase: Gym & Home Workouts", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"183357440", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fitchase-gym-home-workouts/id6749707513?uo=4", "releaseDate":"2025-08-26T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":0}, 
