"description":"Never: Quit Lust, Control & Break Bad Habits\nBreak free from PMO, lust, and compulsive habits and take back control of your life. Never combines neuroscience-backed techniques with real accountability tools to help you quit for good, one day at a time.\n\nWhether you're seeking personal growth, stronger relationships, or a deeper sense of self-control, Never gives you the structure and support to succeed.\n\nWHY PEOPLE TRUST NEVER\n\nWATCH YOUR ORB GROW\u2028\nYour home screen orb evolves with every choice you make. Its color reflects your streak in real time a living symbol of how far you've come, visible at a glance.\n\nREWIRE YOUR MIND\u2028\nBuilt on real behavioral science, our system guides you step by step through urge control and habit change. Your mind is your greatest asset train it like one.\n\nTALK IT THROUGH, ANYTIME\u2028\nYour AI companion is there when cravings hit offering guided meditations, honest motivation, and clear answers about what relapse actually costs you.\n\nRIDE OUT THE URGE\n\u2028When temptation strikes, science based audio techniques help calm your nervous system and get you through the moment without giving in.\n\nTRACK REAL PROGRESS\u2028\nMonitor your streaks, resets, mood, and challenge history in one clean dashboard. See exactly how far your brain has rewired not just how many days you've counted.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\u2028\nYour progress stays private. Never is designed for people who want to make real change without broadcasting it. Every reset is not a failure it's data. Never helps you show up again, stronger, every single time.\nStart your streak today.\n\nPurchases & Subscriptions:\u2028\nNever requires an active weekly or yearly subscription to access the app there is no free version.\n\nThis app offers in-app purchases and auto-renewable subscriptions. Payment is charged to your account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel subscriptions in your account settings.\n\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/never-terms-of-use/\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/never-privacy-policy/", "bundleId":"com.quit.never", "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"Never: Quit Lust & Control", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"56491008", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/never-quit-lust-control/id6797847280?uo=4", "releaseDate":"2026-09-01T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":0}]
